# Fecundity under Spirit of the Labyrinth: "If an effect says that a player can't draw cards and another effect offers that
# player the choice to draw a card, that player can't choose to do so" (CR 121.3). Bot2 has drawn its card for turn 4 when
# Bot1 bolts its Ornithopter, so Spirit's "can't draw more than one card each turn" forbids the draw Fecundity offers, and
# Bot2 is not asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Fecundity
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Spirit of the Labyrinth
Ornithopter
Island x3
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fecundity.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Spirit of the Labyrinth.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Accept
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

